  "id": "chicken-enchiladas-with-bacon-and-ranch",
  "name": "Chicken Enchiladas with Bacon and Ranch",
  "subtitle": "Creamy chicken enchiladas with a savory bacon filling",
  "description": "Corn tortillas are filled with seasoned chicken, bacon, aromatics, and a creamy ranch mixture, then covered with enchilada sauce and cheese and baked until hot.",
